    "prompt": "Expand and collect like terms.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p27-q17-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$\\begin{aligned}&2[(a+b)(a-b)+(a+c)(a-c)+a(b+c)]\\\\&\\quad +(a-b)^2+(a-c)^2+(b-c)^2\\end{aligned}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$6a^2-2bc$\n\nExpand the special products and collect like terms.",
          "worked": "The first bracket gives\n$$\\begin{align*}2[(a+b)(a-b)+(a+c)(a-c)+a(b+c)]&=2[a^2-b^2+a^2-c^2+ab+ac]\\\\2[(a+b)(a-b)+(a+c)(a-c)+a(b+c)]&=4a^2-2b^2-2c^2+2ab+2ac.\\end{align*}$$\nThe remaining squares give\n$$\\begin{align*}(a-b)^2+(a-c)^2+(b-c)^2&=a^2-2ab+b^2+a^2-2ac+c^2+b^2-2bc+c^2\\\\(a-b)^2+(a-c)^2+(b-c)^2&=2a^2+2b^2+2c^2-2ab-2ac-2bc.\\end{align*}$$\nAdding these results gives $6a^2-2bc$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 62
      },
      {
        "id": "p27-q17-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$(a-b)(a^2+a+b)+(a+b)(a^2-a+b)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$2a^3$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(a-b)(a^2+a+b)&=a^3+a^2+ab-a^2b-ab-b^2\\\\(a-b)(a^2+a+b)&=a^3+a^2-a^2b-b^2.\\end{align*}$$\n$$\\begin{align*}(a+b)(a^2-a+b)&=a^3-a^2+ab+a^2b-ab+b^2\\\\(a+b)(a^2-a+b)&=a^3-a^2+a^2b+b^2.\\end{align*}$$\nAdding these results gives $2a^3$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p27-q17-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$\\left(\\frac1a-\\frac1b\\right)^2\\left(\\frac1a+\\frac1b\\right)^2$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac1{a^4}-\\frac2{a^2b^2}+\\frac1{b^4}$\n\nCombine the conjugate factors, then expand the resulting square.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\left(\\frac1a-\\frac1b\\right)^2\\left(\\frac1a+\\frac1b\\right)^2&=\\left[\\left(\\frac1a-\\frac1b\\right)\\left(\\frac1a+\\frac1b\\right)\\right]^2\\\\\\left(\\frac1a-\\frac1b\\right)^2\\left(\\frac1a+\\frac1b\\right)^2&=\\left(\\frac1{a^2}-\\frac1{b^2}\\right)^2\\\\\\left(\\frac1a-\\frac1b\\right)^2\\left(\\frac1a+\\frac1b\\right)^2&=\\frac1{a^4}-\\frac2{a^2b^2}+\\frac1{b^4}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p27-q17-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$\\left(a+\\frac1a\\right)^2\\left(a-\\frac1a\\right)^2$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$a^4-2+\\frac1{a^4}$\n\nCombine the conjugate factors, then expand the resulting square.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\left(a+\\frac1a\\right)^2\\left(a-\\frac1a\\right)^2&=\\left[\\left(a+\\frac1a\\right)\\left(a-\\frac1a\\right)\\right]^2\\\\\\left(a+\\frac1a\\right)^2\\left(a-\\frac1a\\right)^2&=\\left(a^2-\\frac1{a^2}\\right)^2\\\\\\left(a+\\frac1a\\right)^2\\left(a-\\frac1a\\right)^2&=a^4-2+\\frac1{a^4}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 40
      },
      {
        "id": "p27-q17-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "$\\left(2a+\\frac1a\\right)^2-\\left(a-\\frac1a\\right)^2$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$3a^2+6$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\left(2a+\\frac1a\\right)^2-\\left(a-\\frac1a\\right)^2&=4a^2+4+\\frac1{a^2}-\\left(a^2-2+\\frac1{a^2}\\right)\\\\\\left(2a+\\frac1a\\right)^2-\\left(a-\\frac1a\\right)^2&=4a^2+4+\\frac1{a^2}-a^2+2-\\frac1{a^2}\\\\\\left(2a+\\frac1a\\right)^2-\\left(a-\\frac1a\\right)^2&=3a^2+6.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
        "id": "p27-q17-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "$\\left(a+\\frac1b\\right)\\left(b-\\frac1a\\right)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$ab-\\frac1{ab}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\left(a+\\frac1b\\right)\\left(b-\\frac1a\\right)&=ab-\\frac aa+\\frac bb-\\frac1{ab}\\\\\\left(a+\\frac1b\\right)\\left(b-\\frac1a\\right)&=ab-1+1-\\frac1{ab}\\\\\\left(a+\\frac1b\\right)\\left(b-\\frac1a\\right)&=ab-\\frac1{ab}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 27
      },
      {
        "id": "p27-q17-g",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "g",
        "prompt": "$(a+b)^2-[2b(a+b)-(a+b)(b-a)]$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$0$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(a+b)^2-[2b(a+b)-(a+b)(b-a)]&=a^2+2ab+b^2-[2ab+2b^2-(b^2-a^2)]\\\\(a+b)^2-[2b(a+b)-(a+b)(b-a)]&=a^2+2ab+b^2-[a^2+2ab+b^2]\\\\(a+b)^2-[2b(a+b)-(a+b)(b-a)]&=0.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 38
      }
    ]
